Dialogue: 99,0:00:01.74,0:00:06.62,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Exact cum nu poți atinge soarele, \Noricât de mult ți-ai întinde mână,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:06.62,0:00:09.36,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,așa credeam că e ceva \Nimposibil pentru mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:10.05,0:00:13.36,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,De fapt, nici măcar \Nnu încercam să obțin...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:14.25,0:00:16.88,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,acest lucru cunoscut sub \Nnumele de „fericire obișnuită”...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:18.11,0:00:21.32,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Deoarece era ceva de \Ncare nu aveam nevoie.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:21.32,0:00:26.37,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Credeam că voi urma drumul care mi-a \Nfost ales, dar pe care l-am acceptat și eu.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:27.07,0:00:29.18,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Însă sentimentele se schimbă.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.18,0:00:33.90,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Astăzi voi deschide ușa așa cum fac \Nmereu și voi părăsi această cameră...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:35.05,0:00:37.11,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,în căutarea soarelui de primăvară.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:39.99,0:00:42.68,Default,MAN 1,0,0,0,,Ce vremea frumoasă, \Nnu-i așa, domnișoară?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:42.68,0:00:45.08,Default,MAN 1,0,0,0,TLC,Să ajungeți acasă înainte să se facă \Nprea întuneric, bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:50.81,0:00:55.67,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Voi lăsa în urmă faleza mea \Npreferată și viața mea de aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:10.47,0:01:12.72,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Nu mă voi mai întoarce \Nla organizație.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:16.25,0:01:17.22,Default,SUBORDINATE,0,0,0,,Șefule Lancome.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:17.54,0:01:22.33,Main - Top,SUBORDINATE,0,0,0,TLC,Avem un raport că Chloe a fost \Nvăzută astăzi la Stâncile Matool.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:22.33,0:01:23.66,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,,Mergeți și investigați.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:23.66,0:01:25.98,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,TLC,La răsărit, \Nverifică și stâncile de dedesubt.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:25.98,0:01:28.20,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,,Cercetați întreaga zonă.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:28.20,0:01:29.04,Default,SUBORDINATE 1,0,0,0,,Am înțeles.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:30.26,0:01:34.26,Default,MARY,0,0,0,TLC,Lancome, Chloe obișnuiește să meargă \Ndes la stâncile acelea, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:34.26,0:01:35.11,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:35.44,0:01:39.14,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,TLC,Am avertizat-o de multe ori că sunt \Npericuloase, deoarece nu există nicio balustradă.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:39.95,0:01:42.36,Default,MARY,0,0,0,,Oare a pățit ceva?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:42.62,0:01:47.02,Default,MARY,0,0,0,,Logodna noastră a fost destul de \Nșocantă pentru ea. A slăbit atât de mult.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:47.02,0:01:48.17,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,,Destul.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:48.17,0:01:50.38,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,,Nu știm dacă s-a \Nîntâmplat cu adevărat ceva.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:50.84,0:01:51.98,Default,MARY,0,0,0,,Dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:51.98,0:01:53.03,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,,Este în regulă.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:53.03,0:01:54.46,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,,Trebuie să fie o greșeală.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:55.89,0:01:58.01,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,,Chloe este o persoană puternică.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:00.50,0:02:03.51,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Despărțită de familia mea \Nla vârsta de opt ani,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:03.51,0:02:06.48,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,am fost găsită de Lancome, \Ncare era încă un angajat junior.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:06.94,0:02:12.57,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Acum am 27 de ani, iar de atunci am trăit \Nca agentă a Regatului Hagl.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:17.96,0:02:20.03,Default,MAN 2,0,0,0,,Oh, aceea e băutură tare?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:20.03,0:02:22.16,Default,CHLOE,0,0,0,,Într-adevăr. Va fi o călătorie lungă.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:22.16,0:02:23.82,Default,CHLOE,0,0,0,,V-ar plăcea tuturor câte puțin?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.76,0:02:32.62,Main - Top + Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Acum, tot ce își vor aminti despre mine ar trebui \Nsă fie machiajul, alunița sau părul meu roșcat.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:33.20,0:02:35.44,Main - Top + Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Oh, și poate pieptul meu.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.79,0:02:41.20,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Am muncit din greu ca să pot \Ntrimite bani familiei mele.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:41.20,0:02:45.45,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Îl adoram pe Lancome ca pe un frate mai mare \Nși îl respectam ca pe șeful meu.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:46.01,0:02:48.47,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Până când am aflat de trădarea lui.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:50.30,0:02:54.87,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Atunci am decis să renunț \Nla viața de agent.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:03.92,0:03:05.84,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Victoria Sellars...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.84,0:03:09.99,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Este o persoană dispărută \Ncu adevărat în Regatul Randall.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:10.43,0:03:14.42,Main - Top + Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Avem aceeași vârstă și niciuna dintre noi \Nnu are semne distinctive.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:14.42,0:03:17.98,Main - Top + Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Este dispărută de ani de zile \Nși nu are familie.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:18.44,0:03:22.63,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Acum că am trecut două granițe, \Nva fi greu pentru oricine să mă urmărească.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:39.23,0:03:43.66,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,De acum înainte, voi trăi \Npe cont propriu ca Victoria Sellars.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:44.73,0:03:46.93,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Liberă, fără să aparțin nimănui.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:48.27,0:03:53.84,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Și voi fi bine...\Npentru că se întâmplă să am multe fețe.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:33.78,0:05:35.48,Default,RECEPTIONIST,0,0,0,,Să aveți o zi bună.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:40.65,0:05:42.97,Default,BOY 1,0,0,0,,Trebuie să ajungem repede acolo \Nsau vor dispărea cu toții!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:42.97,0:05:43.98,Default,BOY 2,0,0,0,,Grăbiți-vă.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:03.60,0:06:04.75,Default,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:05.09,0:06:06.71,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Copilul acela este încă acolo.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:07.70,0:06:10.25,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Dacă răufăcătorii o răpesc?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:11.31,0:06:12.46,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Ce s-a întâmplat?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:13.59,0:06:15.06,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Te-ai rătăcit?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:15.06,0:06:16.18,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:17.52,0:06:19.02,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Nu m-am rătăcit.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:19.47,0:06:20.94,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Cum te cheamă?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:20.94,0:06:22.01,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Nonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:22.01,0:06:24.05,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Unde sunt părinții tăi, Nonna?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:25.21,0:06:28.02,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Mama mi-a spus să aștept aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:28.02,0:06:31.17,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Și știi la ce oră a fost asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:31.17,0:06:33.52,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Înainte să bată clopotul de zece ori.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:34.03,0:06:36.22,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Deci au trecut mai bine de patru ore...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:37.29,0:06:38.86,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Ți-e foame?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:38.86,0:06:42.92,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Ce-ar fi să mâncăm ceva împreună \Nîn timp ce o așteptăm pe mama ta?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:46.43,0:06:47.90,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:47.90,0:06:49.92,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Mestecă bine și mănâncă încet.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:50.19,0:06:50.96,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:55.61,0:06:57.41,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Câți ani ai, Nonna?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:57.41,0:06:58.76,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Am șase ani.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:03.16,0:07:07.20,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Biata fată așteaptă singură de \Natâta timp.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:10.05,0:07:12.49,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Probabil a fost abandonată.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:12.49,0:07:15.62,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Trebuie să existe o secție de poliție \Nunde pot duce un copil.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:21.55,0:07:22.80,Default,SNATCHER,0,0,0,,Din calea mea!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:22.33,0:07:23.10,Main - Top,MAN 3,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:22.80,0:07:23.54,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Asta nu e bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:23.54,0:07:24.80,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Ar trebui să mă dau la o parte.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:25.65,0:07:26.63,Default,SNATCHER,0,0,0,,Mișcă, mișcă!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:31.81,0:07:33.01,Default,SNATCHER,0,0,0,,Uf!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:33.71,0:07:34.93,Default,SNATCHER,0,0,0,,A durut...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.39,0:07:35.68,Main - Top,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Stai pe loc!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:38.48,0:07:39.89,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Rămâi jos!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:49.69,0:07:51.42,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Ești rănită, domnișoară?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:51.42,0:07:52.19,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:52.47,0:07:53.82,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Vă mulțumesc pentru ajutor.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:56.07,0:07:57.44,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Haide. Sus, te rog.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:56.93,0:08:00.74,Main - Top,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Scuzați-mă, dar îl predați \Ngrăzii?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:01.01,0:08:04.26,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Dacă da, aș putea veni și eu cu dumneavoastră?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:04.55,0:08:06.33,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Poftim? Vrei să vii cu mine?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:09.00,0:08:11.29,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,V-am adus un hoț de buzunare pe care l-am prins.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:11.29,0:08:13.88,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,Oh, excelentă treabă, căpitane.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:13.88,0:08:15.11,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Căpitane?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:16.46,0:08:17.96,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,Dar această doamnă?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:18.39,0:08:20.64,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Ea a găsit un copil abandonat.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:20.64,0:08:22.03,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Speram că vă puteți ocupa de ea.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:24.52,0:08:26.10,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,Vă mulțumesc foarte mult.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:28.55,0:08:30.96,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Ce se va întâmpla cu ea în seara asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:31.38,0:08:33.44,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,Va trebui să rămână aici peste noapte.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:33.88,0:08:36.10,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,Vom contacta casa de copii,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:36.10,0:08:39.24,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,dar cel mai devreme mâine \Npoate veni femeia responsabilă.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:39.86,0:08:41.10,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Mâine...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:45.88,0:08:51.62,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,Ăă, ar fi posibil ca ea \Nsă stea cu mine la hotel în seara asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:52.06,0:08:56.38,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,Abia m-am mutat în această țară, \Nașa că nu am garant,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:56.73,0:09:01.39,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,dar mă doare să o las aici \Ndupă ce am petrecut ziua cu ea.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:01.87,0:09:04.50,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,Nu aveți garant?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:04.50,0:09:10.42,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,Ei bine, nu am cum să știu \Ndacă locuiți cu adevărat la un hotel...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:10.42,0:09:15.22,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Pot merge eu însumi să confirm \Nlocul unde este cazată această domnișoară.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:15.80,0:09:22.46,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Și pe mine mă doare să las fata \Nsingură în această secție mohorâtă.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:26.20,0:09:28.06,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Vă mulțumesc foarte mult.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:28.06,0:09:31.88,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Îmi pare rău să-l deranjez pe căpitanul \NOrdinului Cavaleresc al Doilea.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:32.29,0:09:36.38,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Vă rog, considerați asta un mulțumesc \Npentru ajutorul acordat la prinderea hoțului.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:36.99,0:09:39.13,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,De unde sunteți, domnișoară?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:39.13,0:09:41.66,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Din vecinul Regat Randall.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:41.66,0:09:42.89,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Și cât timp veți rămâne?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:45.00,0:09:47.90,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Mi-am pierdut toată familia într-un incendiu.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:48.97,0:09:51.99,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Am venit aici ca să pot \Nmerge mai departe cu viața mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:52.76,0:09:54.85,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Acesta este răspunsul pe care l-am pregătit.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:54.85,0:09:57.00,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Spune cât mai puține minciuni posibil.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:57.00,0:09:59.66,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Este mai ușor de ținut minte, \Niar povestea nu se va destrăma.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.03,0:10:01.29,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Înțeleg.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:01.77,0:10:03.84,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Vorbiți destul de bine limba noastră.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:03.84,0:10:05.39,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:09.67,0:10:13.60,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Acum că v-am confirmat locul de cazare, \Npermiteți-mi să vă mulțumesc încă o dată
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.60,0:10:16.22,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,pentru ajutorul acordat la arestare \Nși pentru că ați asigurat siguranța acestui copil.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:18.25,0:10:20.18,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Atunci, vă doresc o noapte bună.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.18,0:10:21.68,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Și dumneavoastră.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:30.59,0:10:35.23,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Prima mea zi ca Victoria Sellars \Na fost destul de plină de evenimente.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:36.59,0:10:38.57,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Noapte bună, Nonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:45.43,0:10:47.69,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Bună dimineața, domnișoară.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:50.09,0:10:52.66,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Am cumpărat asta ieri, în drum spre casă.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:52.66,0:10:53.92,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Îți vine perfect.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:56.17,0:10:57.64,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Unde este mama mea?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:58.15,0:10:59.94,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Mi-e teamă că nu a putut veni.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:00.79,0:11:02.76,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Haide. Mănâncă.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:04.60,0:11:07.51,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Cu ce se ocupă mama ta?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:07.51,0:11:08.72,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Nu știu.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:09.22,0:11:11.51,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Ce ai făcut când ai fost singură?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:11.51,0:11:13.32,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Am stat liniștită.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:13.32,0:11:14.64,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Înțeleg.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:14.64,0:11:18.54,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Poate că a crescut \Nfără să învețe prea mult să-și exprime emoțiile.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:19.66,0:11:21.55,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Și când erai cu mama ta?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:21.55,0:11:23.60,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Stăteam liniștită.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:23.60,0:11:26.15,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Ți-a spus mama ta să faci asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.15,0:11:27.00,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:27.71,0:11:31.01,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Cel mai probabil, mama ei nu se va întoarce,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:31.01,0:11:34.61,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,iar chiar dacă se întoarce, nu am încredere că \Ncineva care și-a abandonat copilul o dată
Dialogue: 99,0:11:34.61,0:11:36.74,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,se va îngriji de ea cum trebuie.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:38.71,0:11:40.49,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Nu te implica prea mult...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:41.13,0:11:43.60,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Nu aș putea nicidecum să am grijă de un copil.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.75,0:11:53.04,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Dă-mi un minut.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:55.81,0:11:59.40,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Fundă albastră arată minunat \Ncu frumosul tău păr blond.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:02.75,0:12:04.86,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Atât pot face.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:06.34,0:12:07.57,Default,WOMAN,0,0,0,,Oh, în sfârșit, ai ajuns.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:08.14,0:12:11.14,Default,WOMAN,0,0,0,,Sunt directoarea casei de copii \Ndin cartierul sudic.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:11.14,0:12:14.46,Default,WOMAN,0,0,0,,Vă mulțumesc că ați avut grijă \Nde ea noaptea trecută.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:14.46,0:12:15.56,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Nicio problemă.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.97,0:12:19.17,Default,WOMAN,0,0,0,,Haide, să mergem.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:31.61,0:12:34.56,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Domnișoară... Mulțumesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:44.25,0:12:45.32,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Așteptați!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:45.32,0:12:46.58,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Vă rog, așteptați!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:49.33,0:12:50.51,Default,WOMAN,0,0,0,,Da?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:50.51,0:12:51.58,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Ar fi...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:53.00,0:12:56.48,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Ar fi posibil \Nsă o iau în grijă?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:04.59,0:13:06.35,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Vă mulțumesc foarte mult.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:06.35,0:13:08.59,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Îmi pare rău că v-am chemat \Nîn timp ce erați de serviciu.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:08.59,0:13:10.97,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Ba chiar ați acceptat să-mi fiți garant.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:11.32,0:13:12.43,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Vă rog, n-a fost nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:12.43,0:13:15.48,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Fata este cetățeană a Regatului \NAshbury și trebuie protejată.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:16.15,0:13:18.08,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Dar totuși, de ce ați luat-o în grijă?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:19.02,0:13:22.30,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Am simțit că ochii ei \Nspuneau: „Ajută-mă.”
Dialogue: 99,0:13:22.79,0:13:26.61,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Cu mult timp în urmă, am cunoscut o altă \Nfată cu aceiași ochi.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:26.61,0:13:31.50,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Iar când mi-a amintit de ea, \Nmâna mea s-a întins înainte să-mi dau seama.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:32.33,0:13:35.72,Default,JEFFERY,0,0,0,,Ca să fiu sinceră, am regretat ceva \Ndupă ce am ajuns acasă aseară.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:37.50,0:13:40.70,Default,JEFFERY,0,0,0,,Mi-am dat seama că voi două nu \Nați luat cina.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:40.70,0:13:41.51,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Poftim?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:42.50,0:13:46.75,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Dar știam că nu o veți lăsa \Nși nu veți ieși să cumpărați ceva.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:46.75,0:13:50.37,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Așa că m-am gândit că probabil \Nv-ați culcat flămânde.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:50.37,0:13:53.65,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Ar fi trebuit să vă aduc \Nceva bun de mâncare.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.10,0:13:56.91,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Corect din toate punctele de vedere.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:57.58,0:14:00.48,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Dar nu trebuie să vă învinovățiți.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:00.78,0:14:06.99,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Atunci mă veți ajuta să-mi alung vinovăția \Nlăsându-mă să vă invit la cină în seara asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:09.58,0:14:11.53,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Dacă Nonna poate veni cu noi.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:14.41,0:14:18.38,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Nonna, hai să căutăm un loc \Nîn care să locuim împreună.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:18.79,0:14:23.41,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Dacă putem închiria undeva \Ncu bucătărie, îți pot găti.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:23.73,0:14:24.82,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Să gătești?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:24.82,0:14:28.40,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Exact. Ce fel \Nde mâncare îți place?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.89,0:14:29.97,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Chifle.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.74,0:14:32.22,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Înțeleg.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:32.22,0:14:34.76,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Vom încerca să-ți extindem preferințele.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:35.34,0:14:38.87,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Vom avea o mulțime \Nde mâncare delicioasă în fiecare zi.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:38.87,0:14:40.48,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Îți voi găti.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:41.30,0:14:43.61,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc, domnișoară.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:49.39,0:14:53.36,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Ascultă, de azi înainte, \Ntu și cu mine suntem familie, Nonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:54.16,0:14:56.24,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Așa că spune-mi Victoria, bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:56.86,0:14:58.58,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Vicky e bine și ea.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:59.44,0:15:00.44,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:02.09,0:15:03.74,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Vom face să meargă, Nonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:04.29,0:15:07.39,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Acum, hai să căutăm un loc de închiriat.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:12.64,0:15:17.17,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Cine ar fi crezut că vei fi refuzată \Nla ușă doar pentru că ai un copil?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:17.17,0:15:19.69,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Toată lumea a fost copil la un moment dat!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:20.14,0:15:22.91,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Mă voi ruga ca de fiecare dată când \Nproprietarul acela iese undeva,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:22.91,0:15:25.14,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,să calce din greșeală în rahat de câine.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:26.09,0:15:30.98,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Nonna, mă duc să caut \Nși în alte locuri după lăsarea întunericului.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:30.98,0:15:35.08,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Așa că te rog să nu te sperii dacă \Nnu sunt aici când te trezești.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:36.28,0:15:37.66,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Vin cu tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:37.97,0:15:41.92,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Va fi târziu în noapte, \Nașa că nu pot lua un copil cu mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:45.29,0:15:47.23,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Nu vreau să rămân în urmă.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:51.91,0:15:55.64,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,În cazul acesta, Nonna, îmi poți promite \Nceea ce urmează să-ți cer?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:56.09,0:16:00.20,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Când îți spun să taci, \Nnu scoate niciun sunet, orice s-ar întâmpla.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:00.20,0:16:01.31,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:01.31,0:16:04.43,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Când îți spun să fugi, \Naleargă cât de repede poți și ascunde-te.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.43,0:16:05.45,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Voi fugi.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:05.45,0:16:07.81,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Când spun să țipi, \Nfă-o cât poți de tare.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:07.81,0:16:08.61,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Voi țipa!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:08.61,0:16:11.72,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Când spun îngheață, nu mișca niciun mușchi.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:11.72,0:16:13.11,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Voi îngheța.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:14.40,0:16:16.17,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Nu se plânge.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:16.61,0:16:20.77,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Poate că nu se comportă ca un copil pentru că \Nnu i s-a permis niciodată să fie unul.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:21.77,0:16:25.43,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Te voi învăța \Ncum să te protejezi singură.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:25.43,0:16:26.88,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Să mă protejez singură?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.88,0:16:30.03,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Da, îți voi da abilitățile necesare.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:30.03,0:16:34.82,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Când se întâmplă ceva înfricoșător, să faci scandal \Nsau să plângi nu va rezolva problema.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:34.82,0:16:36.64,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Depinde de tine să rămâi în siguranță.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:37.39,0:16:38.64,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Bine!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:39.08,0:16:42.98,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Acum este aproape timpul să plecăm, \Nașa că hai să ne schimbăm.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:44.29,0:16:46.54,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Arăți frumoasă, domnișoară.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:46.54,0:16:49.35,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc. Și tu ești frumoasă, Nonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:57.26,0:16:58.99,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Vrei să o pui?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:58.99,0:17:02.92,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Da. Este prima mea fundă.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:07.52,0:17:09.39,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Da? Cine este?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:09.39,0:17:11.62,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Sunt eu, Jeffrey Asher.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:12.12,0:17:13.42,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Lasă-mă să deschid ușa.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:14.70,0:17:16.71,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Bună seara, căpitane.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:18.69,0:17:21.10,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Doamne, arătați amândouă foarte bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.11,0:17:26.85,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Sunt client obișnuit aici, așa că garantez \Ncă mâncarea este bună.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:26.85,0:17:28.13,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Sunt nerăbdătoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:31.12,0:17:34.47,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Ești sigur că a fost în regulă \Nsă ne aduci aici?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:34.47,0:17:36.12,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Nu este nicio problemă.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:36.12,0:17:38.03,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Sunt un burlac fără griji.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:38.03,0:17:39.54,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Ce bine de auzit.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:39.54,0:17:43.21,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Nu aș vrea să atrag mânia \Ncuiva care te place.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:44.60,0:17:46.75,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Nu există nimeni așa.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:47.07,0:17:50.24,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Oh, ba da. Și încă din plin.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:50.77,0:17:52.41,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Ce este carnea asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:52.41,0:17:55.13,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Este miel la grătar cu ierburi.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:55.13,0:17:56.47,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:58.39,0:17:59.46,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Este bun?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:59.46,0:18:00.19,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:00.60,0:18:05.45,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Sper că nu este prea târziu pentru Nonna, \Ndin moment ce eu a trebuit să termin munca.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:05.45,0:18:07.93,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Sunt bine. Vom merge să vedem niște locuri.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:08.73,0:18:10.31,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Undeva de închiriat?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:10.31,0:18:12.18,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Este periculos să iei un copil noaptea.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:12.18,0:18:17.02,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Adevărat, dar trebuie să vezi cum este \Nun loc după lăsarea întunericului înainte să semnezi,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:17.02,0:18:19.35,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,ca să nu ajungi cu o afacere proastă.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:19.35,0:18:21.05,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Atunci permiteți-mi să vin cu voi.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:21.52,0:18:24.83,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Poate fi deranjant, \Ndar, ca garant al vostru, trebuie să insist.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:25.97,0:18:30.08,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Dacă vine cu noi, nu pot cerceta zona, \Nceea ce nu este de ajutor, dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:30.08,0:18:33.19,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Deranjant? Dimpotrivă, \Neste liniștitor.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:34.43,0:18:38.00,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Să-mi dezvălui atât de ușor \Nadresa altora...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:38.43,0:18:43.10,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Cât de precaută pot fi \Nca femeie și civilă obișnuită?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:43.68,0:18:46.49,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Ar fi de neconceput ca agentă,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:46.49,0:18:51.10,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,dar mă îndoiesc că domnul Asher va \Nintra prin efracție și ne va ucide.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:53.15,0:18:57.23,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Îmi pare rău că v-am târât \Nsă veniți să vedeți proprietatea cu noi.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:57.81,0:19:01.08,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Nicidecum. Abia ați \Najuns în această țară.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:01.08,0:19:03.65,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Nu știu cum erau lucrurile în Randall,
Dialogue: 99,0:19:03.65,0:19:07.54,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,dar aici nu este tocmai sigur \Npentru o femeie să care un copil în spate
Dialogue: 99,0:19:07.54,0:19:09.15,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,în timp ce merge singură noaptea.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:09.15,0:19:10.62,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Vă sunt recunoscătoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:12.77,0:19:16.60,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Oricum, ashburiana dumneavoastră \Neste cu adevărat excelentă.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:17.05,0:19:19.01,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Cu ce vă ocupați în Randall?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:23.11,0:19:24.39,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Oh, cu una, cu alta.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:24.89,0:19:28.92,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Dacă voi avea ocazia să vă mai văd, \Npoate vă voi povesti câte ceva.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:31.69,0:19:35.00,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Atunci voi aștepta cu nerăbdare \Nziua în care ne vom întâlni din nou.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:36.59,0:19:39.48,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Am avut o seară minunată, căpitane.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:39.48,0:19:42.12,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,La fel. Noapte bună.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:42.12,0:19:43.46,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Noapte bună.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:50.48,0:19:52.18,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Nicio urmă de pași.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:55.38,0:19:57.46,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Nicio urmă că ușa a fost deschisă.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:58.21,0:20:00.38,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Presupun că, în mod normal, nu ar fi...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:12.13,0:20:14.39,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Îmi pare rău. V-am trezit?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:15.33,0:20:18.28,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Mielul a fost delicios.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:18.28,0:20:20.94,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,A fost. Îți voi găti și eu cândva.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:21.28,0:20:22.69,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Serios?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:22.69,0:20:23.94,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Desigur.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:24.58,0:20:27.70,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Vreau să gătesc și eu.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:28.21,0:20:30.57,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Sigur, te voi învăța.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:31.26,0:20:34.68,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Te voi învăța tot ce știu.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:36.00,0:20:36.94,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:38.37,0:20:39.41,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Ăă...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:41.61,0:20:44.09,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc, Vicky.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:50.29,0:20:54.14,Default,VICTOIRA,0,0,0,,Nonna, vom duce o viață fericită \Nplină de multe râsete.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:54.67,0:20:55.84,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Râsete?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:56.52,0:21:00.25,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Exact. Așa!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:01.53,0:21:04.72,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Face gâdilă, Vicky!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:08.01,0:21:12.41,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Am de gând să o învăț tot ce știu.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:14.58,0:21:19.30,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Pentru că până și un copil \No duce mai bine cu multe fețe.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:25.35,0:21:28.48,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Domnișoara Victoria mai stă aici?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:28.48,0:21:29.82,Default,RECEPTIONIST,0,0,0,,Nu, domnule.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:29.82,0:21:31.85,Default,RECEPTIONIST,0,0,0,,Totuși, v-a lăsat o scrisoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.10,0:21:32.93,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:35.06,0:21:38.36,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Dragă căpitane Jeffrey Asher \Nal Ordinului al Doilea...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:38.36,0:21:40.80,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Vă mulțumesc pentru cealaltă zi.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:40.80,0:21:44.75,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Am găsit cu succes un loc de muncă \Nși un loc de închiriat.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:45.15,0:21:50.40,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Înțeleg că sunt obligată să vă trimit, \Ngarantului meu, un raport lunar.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:50.75,0:21:54.62,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Vă rog să vă așteptați la raportul meu \Nla ordin peste o lună.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:55.03,0:21:56.57,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Victoria Sellars.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:57.16,0:21:59.18,Default,JEFFERY,0,0,0,,Foarte administrativ.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:00.99,0:22:02.37,Default,JEFFERY,0,0,0,,E în regulă.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:02.37,0:22:05.12,Default,JEFFERY,0,0,0,,Dacă soarta îngăduie, \Nsunt sigur că o voi revedea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.22,0:01:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad1\bord.5\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\b1\pos(320,300)\3c&H21282B&\4c&H21282B&}Special Operations Force Central Control Room, Kingdom of Hagl
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.54,0:02:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Granița Regatului Randall
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.95,0:03:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,1)\shad1\bord.1\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\b1\3c&H21282B&\4c&H21282B&\pos(550.769,190.462)}Regatul Hagl
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.49,0:03:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,1)\shad1\bord.1\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\b1\3c&H21282B&\4c&H21282B&\pos(391.384,92.616)}Regatul Randall
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.58,0:03:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,1)\shad1\bord.1\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\b1\3c&H21282B&\4c&H21282B&\pos(185.846,200.308)}Regatul Ashbury
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.71,0:03:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad1\bord.1\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\b1\pos(320,300)\3c&H21282B&\4c&H21282B&}Granița Regatului Ashbury
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(2190,1)\shad1\bord.1\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\b1\pos(320,300)\3c&H21282B&\4c&H21282B&}Capitala regală a Regatului Ashbury
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.73,0:04:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Victoria cea cu multe fețe
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.97,0:05:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Episodul 1 Liberă și nelegată de nimeni
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.09,0:21:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,2 săptămâni mai târziu
Dialogue: 99,0:00:01.74,0:00:06.62,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Just as it was impossible to grasp \Nthe sun no matter how far I stretched,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:06.62,0:00:09.36,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,I thought it was unattainable.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:10.05,0:00:13.36,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Rather, I wasn't even trying to attain it,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:14.25,0:00:16.88,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,this thing known as\N "ordinary happiness"...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:18.11,0:00:21.32,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Because I had no need of it.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:21.32,0:00:26.37,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,I believed that I would walk the path\N chosen both for and by me.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:27.07,0:00:29.18,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,But feelings change.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.18,0:00:33.90,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Today, I'm going to open the door like \NI always do and leave this room...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:35.05,0:00:37.11,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,in search of the spring sun.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:39.99,0:00:42.68,Default,MAN 1,0,0,0,,Nice weather, isn't it, miss?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:42.68,0:00:45.08,Default,MAN 1,0,0,0,,Do get home before it gets \Ntoo dark, all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:50.81,0:00:55.67,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,I will leave behind my favorite cliff\Nand my life here.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:10.47,0:01:12.72,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,I'm not going back to the organization.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:16.25,0:01:17.22,Default,SUBORDINATE,0,0,0,,Chief Lancome.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:17.54,0:01:22.33,Main - Top,SUBORDINATE,0,0,0,,There's a report that Chloe was \Nseen at the Matool Cliffs today.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:22.33,0:01:23.66,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,,Go investigate.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:23.66,0:01:25.98,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,,Come morning, \Ncheck the rocks below as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:25.98,0:01:28.20,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,,Comb the area.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:28.20,0:01:29.04,Default,SUBORDINATE 1,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:30.26,0:01:34.26,Default,MARY,0,0,0,,Lancome, Chloe likes to frequent \Nthose cliffs, doesn't she?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:34.26,0:01:35.11,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:35.44,0:01:39.14,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,,I've warned her many times that they're\Ndangerous since there's no fence.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:39.95,0:01:42.36,Default,MARY,0,0,0,,Has something happened to her?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:42.62,0:01:47.02,Default,MARY,0,0,0,,Our engagement came as quite\N a shock to her. She's grown so thin.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:47.02,0:01:48.17,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:48.17,0:01:50.38,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,,We don't know if anything has\Nactually happened.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:50.84,0:01:51.98,Default,MARY,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:51.98,0:01:53.03,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:53.03,0:01:54.46,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,,It must be a mistake.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:55.89,0:01:58.01,Default,LANCOME,0,0,0,,Chloe is a strong person.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:00.50,0:02:03.51,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Separated from my family \Nat the age of eight,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:03.51,0:02:06.48,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,I was picked up by Lancome, \Nwho was still a junior employee.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:06.94,0:02:12.57,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,I'm 27 now, and ever since, I've lived\N as an agent of the Kingdom of Hagl.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:17.96,0:02:20.03,Default,MAN 2,0,0,0,,Oh, is that hard liquor?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:20.03,0:02:22.16,Default,CHLOE,0,0,0,,Indeed. It's going to be a long journey.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:22.16,0:02:23.82,Default,CHLOE,0,0,0,,Would you all care for some?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.76,0:02:32.62,Main - Top + Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Now all they'll remember about me should \Nbe my makeup, my mole, or my red hair.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:33.20,0:02:35.44,Main - Top + Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Oh, and maybe my chest.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.79,0:02:41.20,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,I worked hard so that I could \Nsend money to my family.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:41.20,0:02:45.45,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,I adored Lancome like a big brother \Nand respected him as my boss.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:46.01,0:02:48.47,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Until I learned of his betrayal, that is.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:50.30,0:02:54.87,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,It was then that I decided to walk away\N from the operative life.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:03.92,0:03:05.84,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Victoria Sellars...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.84,0:03:09.99,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,She's a real missing person \Nin the Kingdom of Randall.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:10.43,0:03:14.42,Main - Top + Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,We're the same age and neither of us\Nhave any identifying marks.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:14.42,0:03:17.98,Main - Top + Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,She's been missing for years\Nand has no family.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:18.44,0:03:22.63,Main - Italics,CHLOE/I,0,0,0,,Now that I've crossed two borders,\Nit'll be tough for anyone to track me.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:39.23,0:03:43.66,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,From now on, I'm going to live \Nlife on my own as Victoria Sellars.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:44.73,0:03:46.93,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Free, unbound by anyone.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:48.27,0:03:53.84,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,And I'll be fine...\Nbecause I happen to have many faces.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:33.78,0:05:35.48,Default,RECEPTIONIST,0,0,0,,Have a good day.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:40.65,0:05:42.97,Default,BOY 1,0,0,0,,We've gotta get there quick \Nor they'll all be gone!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:42.97,0:05:43.98,Default,BOY 2,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:03.60,0:06:04.75,Default,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:05.09,0:06:06.71,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,That child is still there.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:07.70,0:06:10.25,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,What if villains make off with her?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:11.31,0:06:12.46,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:13.59,0:06:15.06,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Are you lost?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:15.06,0:06:16.18,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:17.52,0:06:19.02,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,I'm not lost.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:19.47,0:06:20.94,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:20.94,0:06:22.01,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Nonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:22.01,0:06:24.05,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Where are your parents, Nonna?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:25.21,0:06:28.02,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Mom told me to wait here.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:28.02,0:06:31.17,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,And do you know what time that was?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:31.17,0:06:33.52,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Before the bell struck ten times.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:34.03,0:06:36.22,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,So over four hours ago...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:37.29,0:06:38.86,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:38.86,0:06:42.92,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Shall we share a bite \Nwhile we wait here for your mother?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:46.43,0:06:47.90,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:47.90,0:06:49.92,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Chew well and eat slowly.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:50.19,0:06:50.96,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:55.61,0:06:57.41,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,How old are you, Nonna?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:57.41,0:06:58.76,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,I'm six.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:03.16,0:07:07.20,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,She's been waiting all alone \Nfor so long, the poor girl.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:10.05,0:07:12.49,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,She must have been abandoned.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:12.49,0:07:15.62,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,There has to be a station\Nsomewhere I can take a child.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:21.55,0:07:22.80,Default,SNATCHER,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:22.33,0:07:23.10,Main - Top,MAN 3,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:22.80,0:07:23.54,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,This is trouble.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:23.54,0:07:24.80,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,I should step aside.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:25.65,0:07:26.63,Default,SNATCHER,0,0,0,,Move it, move it!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:31.81,0:07:33.01,Default,SNATCHER,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:33.71,0:07:34.93,Default,SNATCHER,0,0,0,,That hurt...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.39,0:07:35.68,Main - Top,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:38.48,0:07:39.89,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Stay down!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:49.69,0:07:51.42,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Are you hurt, miss?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:51.42,0:07:52.19,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:52.47,0:07:53.82,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Thank you for your assistance.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:56.07,0:07:57.44,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Come on. Up you go.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:56.93,0:08:00.74,Main - Top,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Pardon, but are you handing him\Nover to the watch?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:01.01,0:08:04.26,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,If so, might I come with you?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:04.55,0:08:06.33,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,What? You want to come with me?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:09.00,0:08:11.29,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,I brought you a purse snatcher I caught.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:11.29,0:08:13.88,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,Oh, excellent work, Captain.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:13.88,0:08:15.11,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Captain?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:16.46,0:08:17.96,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,And this lady here?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:18.39,0:08:20.64,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,She found an abandoned child.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:20.64,0:08:22.03,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,I was hoping you could handle it.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:24.52,0:08:26.10,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:28.55,0:08:30.96,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,What happens to her tonight?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:31.38,0:08:33.44,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,She'll have to spend the night here.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:33.88,0:08:36.10,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,We'll contact the children's home,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:36.10,0:08:39.24,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,but tomorrow is the earliest\Nthe woman in charge can make it.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:39.86,0:08:41.10,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Tomorrow...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:45.88,0:08:51.62,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,Er, would it be possible for her\Nto stay with me at the hotel for tonight?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:52.06,0:08:56.38,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,I only just moved to this country, \Nso I have no guarantor,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:56.73,0:09:01.39,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,but it pains me to leave her here\Nafter spending the day with her.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:01.87,0:09:04.50,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,You have no guarantor?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:04.50,0:09:10.42,Default,SUBORDINATE 2,0,0,0,,Well, I have no way of knowing\Nif you're really staying at a hotel...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:10.42,0:09:15.22,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,I can go myself and confirm\Nthis young lady's lodgings.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:15.80,0:09:22.46,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,It also pains me to leave the girl\Nall alone in this dingy station.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:26.20,0:09:28.06,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:28.06,0:09:31.88,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,I hate to trouble the captain\N of the Second Knightly Order.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:32.29,0:09:36.38,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Please, consider this a thank-you\Nfor your help apprehending that thief.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:36.99,0:09:39.13,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Where do you hail from, miss?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:39.13,0:09:41.66,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,From the neighboring Kingdom of Randall.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:41.66,0:09:42.89,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,And how long are you staying?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:45.00,0:09:47.90,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,I lost all of my family in a fire.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:48.97,0:09:51.99,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,I came here so I could \Nmove on with my life.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:52.76,0:09:54.85,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,This is the answer I've prepared.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:54.85,0:09:57.00,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Tell as few lies as possible.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:57.00,0:09:59.66,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,It's easier to remember, \Nand the story won't fall apart.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.03,0:10:01.29,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:01.77,0:10:03.84,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,You speak our language rather well.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:03.84,0:10:05.39,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:09.67,0:10:13.60,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Now that I've confirmed your lodgings,\Nallow me to thank you once again
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.60,0:10:16.22,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,for your help in the arrest\Nand ensuring this child's safety.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:18.25,0:10:20.18,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Well then, a good night to you.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.18,0:10:21.68,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,A good night to you too.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:30.59,0:10:35.23,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,My first day as Victoria Sellars\N was rather eventful.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:36.59,0:10:38.57,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Good night, Nonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:45.43,0:10:47.69,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Good morning, miss.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:50.09,0:10:52.66,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,I bought this on the way back yesterday.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:52.66,0:10:53.92,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,It fits you perfectly.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:56.17,0:10:57.64,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Where's my mom?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:58.15,0:10:59.94,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,I'm afraid she couldn't come.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:00.79,0:11:02.76,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Go on. Eat up.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:04.60,0:11:07.51,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,What kind of work does your mother do?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:07.51,0:11:08.72,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:09.22,0:11:11.51,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,What did you do when you were alone?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:11.51,0:11:13.32,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Stayed quiet.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:13.32,0:11:14.64,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:14.64,0:11:18.54,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Perhaps she's grown up\Nwithout learning to emote much.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:19.66,0:11:21.55,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,And when you were with your mother?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:21.55,0:11:23.60,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Stayed quiet.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:23.60,0:11:26.15,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Did your mother tell you to do that?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.15,0:11:27.00,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:27.71,0:11:31.01,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Her mother most likely won't come back,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:31.01,0:11:34.61,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,and even if she does, I don't trust that\Nsomeone who's abandoned their child once
Dialogue: 99,0:11:34.61,0:11:36.74,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,would look after her properly.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:38.71,0:11:40.49,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Don't get too involved...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:41.13,0:11:43.60,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,I couldn't possibly take care of a child.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.75,0:11:53.04,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Give me a minute.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:55.81,0:11:59.40,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,This blue ribbon looks great\Nwith your beautiful blonde hair.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:02.75,0:12:04.86,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,This is the best I can do.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:06.34,0:12:07.57,Default,WOMAN,0,0,0,,Oh, finally, you're here.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:08.14,0:12:11.14,Default,WOMAN,0,0,0,,I'm the director of the children's \Nhome in the southern quarter.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:11.14,0:12:14.46,Default,WOMAN,0,0,0,,Thank you for watching \Nover her last night.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:14.46,0:12:15.56,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.97,0:12:19.17,Default,WOMAN,0,0,0,,Come, let's go.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:31.61,0:12:34.56,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Miss... Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:44.25,0:12:45.32,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:45.32,0:12:46.58,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:49.33,0:12:50.51,Default,WOMAN,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:50.51,0:12:51.58,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Would it...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:53.00,0:12:56.48,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Would it be possible \Nfor me to take her in?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:04.59,0:13:06.35,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:06.35,0:13:08.59,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for calling for you\N while you're on duty.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:08.59,0:13:10.97,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,You even agreed to be my guarantor.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:11.32,0:13:12.43,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Please, it was nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:12.43,0:13:15.48,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,The girl is a citizen of the Kingdom\Nof Ashbury and ought to be protected.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:16.15,0:13:18.08,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,But still, why did you take her in?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:19.02,0:13:22.30,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,It felt like her eyes \Nwere saying, "Help me."
Dialogue: 99,0:13:22.79,0:13:26.61,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Long ago, I knew another \Ngirl with those same eyes.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:26.61,0:13:31.50,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,And when I was reminded of her, \Nmy hand reached out before I knew it.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:32.33,0:13:35.72,Default,JEFFERY,0,0,0,,To be honest, I regretted something \Nafter I went home last night.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:37.50,0:13:40.70,Default,JEFFERY,0,0,0,,I realized you two hadn't had dinner.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:40.70,0:13:41.51,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:42.50,0:13:46.75,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,But I knew you wouldn't leave \Nher and go out to get something.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:46.75,0:13:50.37,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,So I figured you probably \Nwent to bed hungry.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:50.37,0:13:53.65,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,I should have brought you \Ntwo something good to eat.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.10,0:13:56.91,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Correct on all counts.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:57.58,0:14:00.48,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,But you needn't blame yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:00.78,0:14:06.99,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Then will you help me ease my guilt\N by letting me buy you dinner tonight?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:09.58,0:14:11.53,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,If Nonna can come with us.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:14.41,0:14:18.38,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Nonna, let's look for a place \Nfor us to live together.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:18.79,0:14:23.41,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,If we can rent somewhere \Nwith a kitchen, I can cook for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:23.73,0:14:24.82,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Cook?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:24.82,0:14:28.40,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,That's right. What kind\N of food do you like?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.89,0:14:29.97,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Dinner rolls.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.74,0:14:32.22,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:32.22,0:14:34.76,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,We'll work on expanding your favorites.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:35.34,0:14:38.87,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,We're going to have lots \Nof delicious food every single day.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:38.87,0:14:40.48,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,I'll cook for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:41.30,0:14:43.61,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Thank you, miss.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:49.39,0:14:53.36,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Listen, starting today, \Nyou and I are family, Nonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:54.16,0:14:56.24,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,So call me Victoria, won't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:56.86,0:14:58.58,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Vicky works too.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:59.44,0:15:00.44,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:02.09,0:15:03.74,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,We'll make this work, Nonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:04.29,0:15:07.39,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Now, let's go look for a place to rent.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:12.64,0:15:17.17,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Who knew you'd get turned away\N at the door for simply having a child?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:17.17,0:15:19.69,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Everyone was a child at one point!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:20.14,0:15:22.91,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,I'll pray that every time that \Nlandlord goes out somewhere,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:22.91,0:15:25.14,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,he accidentally steps in dog poop.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:26.09,0:15:30.98,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Nonna, I'm going to go look\Nat other places after dark.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:30.98,0:15:35.08,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,So please don't be alarmed if \NI'm not here when you wake up.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:36.28,0:15:37.66,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,I'll come with you.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:37.97,0:15:41.92,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,It'll be late at night, \Nso I can't take a child with me.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:45.29,0:15:47.23,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,I don't want to stay behind.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:51.91,0:15:55.64,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,In that case, Nonna, can you promise me \Nwhat I'm about to ask you?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:56.09,0:16:00.20,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,When I tell you to be silent, \Ndon't make a peep no matter what.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:00.20,0:16:01.31,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:01.31,0:16:04.43,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,When I tell you to run, \Ngo as fast as you can and hide.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.43,0:16:05.45,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,I'll run.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:05.45,0:16:07.81,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,When I say scream,\N do it at the top of your lungs.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:07.81,0:16:08.61,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,I'll scream!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:08.61,0:16:11.72,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,When I say freeze, don't move a muscle.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:11.72,0:16:13.11,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,I'll freeze.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:14.40,0:16:16.17,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,She doesn't complain.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:16.61,0:16:20.77,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Maybe she doesn't act like a child because\Nshe's never been allowed to be one.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:21.77,0:16:25.43,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,I'm going to teach you \Nhow to protect yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:25.43,0:16:26.88,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Protect myself?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.88,0:16:30.03,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll give you the skills to do so.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:30.03,0:16:34.82,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,When something scary happens, acting up\N or crying won't solve the problem.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:34.82,0:16:36.64,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,It's up to you to keep yourself safe.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:37.39,0:16:38.64,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:39.08,0:16:42.98,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Now, it's almost time to go, \Nso let's get changed.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:44.29,0:16:46.54,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,You look beautiful, miss.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:46.54,0:16:49.35,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Thank you. You're beautiful too, Nonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:57.26,0:16:58.99,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Want to put it on?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:58.99,0:17:02.92,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's my first ribbon.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:07.52,0:17:09.39,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Yes? Who is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:09.39,0:17:11.62,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,It's me, Jeffrey Asher.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:12.12,0:17:13.42,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Let me open the door.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:14.70,0:17:16.71,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Good evening, Captain.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:18.69,0:17:21.10,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Goodness, you both look very nice.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.11,0:17:26.85,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,I'm a regular here, so I guarantee \Nyou the food is good.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:26.85,0:17:28.13,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,I'm excited.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:31.12,0:17:34.47,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Are you sure it was all right \Nto bring us here?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:34.47,0:17:36.12,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,It's not a problem.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:36.12,0:17:38.03,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,I am a carefree bachelor.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:38.03,0:17:39.54,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,That's good to hear.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:39.54,0:17:43.21,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want to earn the ire\Nof anyone who has their eye on you.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:44.60,0:17:46.75,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,There isn't anyone like that.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:47.07,0:17:50.24,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, there is. In spades to boot.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:50.77,0:17:52.41,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,What is this meat?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:52.41,0:17:55.13,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,It's grilled lamb with herbs.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:55.13,0:17:56.47,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:58.39,0:17:59.46,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:59.46,0:18:00.19,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:00.60,0:18:05.45,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,I hope this isn't too late for Nonna,\Nsince it had to be after work for me.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:05.45,0:18:07.93,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,I'm fine. We're going to look at places.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:08.73,0:18:10.31,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Somewhere to rent?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:10.31,0:18:12.18,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,It's dangerous to take a child at night.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:12.18,0:18:17.02,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,That's true, but you need to see what \Na place is like after dark before signing,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:17.02,0:18:19.35,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,lest you find yourself with a raw deal.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:19.35,0:18:21.05,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Then allow me to come with you.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:21.52,0:18:24.83,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,It may be a bother, \Nbut as your guarantor, I must insist.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:25.97,0:18:30.08,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,If he comes along, I can't probe the area,\Nwhich isn't helpful, but...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:30.08,0:18:33.19,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,A bother? On the contrary, \Nit's reassuring.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:34.43,0:18:38.00,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,So readily disclosing \Nmy address to others...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:38.43,0:18:43.10,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,How cagey can I get away with being\Nas an ordinary woman and civilian?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:43.68,0:18:46.49,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,This would be unthinkable as an agent,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:46.49,0:18:51.10,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,but I doubt Mr. Asher is going \Nto break in and kill us.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:53.15,0:18:57.23,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for dragging you \Nto come see the property with us.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:57.81,0:19:01.08,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Not at all. You only just \Narrived in this country.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:01.08,0:19:03.65,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,I don't know how things were in Randall,
Dialogue: 99,0:19:03.65,0:19:07.54,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,but here, it's not exactly safe\Nfor a woman to carry a child on her back
Dialogue: 99,0:19:07.54,0:19:09.15,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,while walking around alone at night.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:09.15,0:19:10.62,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:12.77,0:19:16.60,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,At any rate, your Ashburian \Nreally is excellent.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:17.05,0:19:19.01,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,What was your line of work Randall?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:23.11,0:19:24.39,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Oh, this and that.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:24.89,0:19:28.92,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,If I have a chance to see you again, \Nmaybe I can share my stories.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:31.69,0:19:35.00,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Then I shall look forward \Nto the day we meet again.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:36.59,0:19:39.48,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,I had a wonderful night, Captain.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:39.48,0:19:42.12,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Likewise. Good night.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:42.12,0:19:43.46,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:50.48,0:19:52.18,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,No footprints.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:55.38,0:19:57.46,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,No trace the door was opened.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:58.21,0:20:00.38,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,I guess there normally wouldn't be...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:12.13,0:20:14.39,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Did I wake you up?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:15.33,0:20:18.28,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,The lamb was tasty.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:18.28,0:20:20.94,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,It was. I'll cook it for you sometime.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:21.28,0:20:22.69,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:22.69,0:20:23.94,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:24.58,0:20:27.70,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,I want to cook too.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:28.21,0:20:30.57,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,Sure, I'll teach you.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:31.26,0:20:34.68,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,I'll teach you everything I know.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:36.00,0:20:36.94,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:38.37,0:20:39.41,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:41.61,0:20:44.09,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Thank you, Vicky.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:50.29,0:20:54.14,Default,VICTOIRA,0,0,0,,Nonna, we'll live a happy life\Nfull of lots of laughter.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:54.67,0:20:55.84,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,Laughter?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:56.52,0:21:00.25,Default,VICTORIA,0,0,0,,That's right. Just like this!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:01.53,0:21:04.72,Default,NONNA,0,0,0,,That's tickly, Vicky!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:08.01,0:21:12.41,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,I am going to teach her everything I know.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:14.58,0:21:19.30,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Because even a child \Nis better off with many faces.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:25.35,0:21:28.48,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,Is Miss Victoria still staying here?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:28.48,0:21:29.82,Default,RECEPTIONIST,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:29.82,0:21:31.85,Default,RECEPTIONIST,0,0,0,,She did leave a letter for you, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.10,0:21:32.93,Default,JEFFREY,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:35.06,0:21:38.36,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Dear Captain Jeffrey Asher \Nof the Second Order...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:38.36,0:21:40.80,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Thank you for the other day.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:40.80,0:21:44.75,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,I've successfully found a job\Nand a place to rent.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:45.15,0:21:50.40,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,I understand I'm obliged to send you, \Nmy guarantor, a monthly report.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:50.75,0:21:54.62,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Please expect my report\N at the order in a month's time.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:55.03,0:21:56.57,Main - Italics,VICTORIA/I,0,0,0,,Victoria Sellars.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:57.16,0:21:59.18,Default,JEFFERY,0,0,0,,Quite administrative.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:00.99,0:22:02.37,Default,JEFFERY,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:02.37,0:22:05.12,Default,JEFFERY,0,0,0,,If fate allows,\N I'm sure I'll see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.85,0:21:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,
